      "order": 2,
      "alignment": "left",
      "vertical_alignment": "center",
      "body": "The only tile on this tab that is not metadata: Shannon diversity per sample, reached through the project link from the metadata sample column. Moving a CTD slider on the left really does shrink this figure, which is the point of the whole tab. It is also what keeps the tab alive, since a tab whose every visualisation sits on a metadata collection is pruned at import.",
